                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Alloy Steel AMS 6304 (17-22A) | UNS# K14675 is a structural low alloy steel that demonstrates exceptionally high strength, high-temperature strength, and excellent heat resistance. Because of these traits, AMS 6404 (17-22A) is generally used for manufacturing aviation parts, mechanical parts for engines, industrial furnaces, turbine rotors, petrochemical engineering operations, steam turbines, shafts, studs, fasteners, missile components, and many other similar applications."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Alloy Steel AMS 6304 (17-22A) Specifications:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[AMS 2301](https://titanium.com/ams-2301-specification/) , [AMS 6304](https://titanium.com/ams-6304-specification/)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "ASTM A193 (CHEMISTRY ONLY)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Alloy Steel AMS 6304 (17-22A) product forms offered at all Titanium Industries’ locations:"
